(21, 53, '61,64', 19, 15, 7, 8, 13, 2, 3, 3, 0, 3, '1. Sriwahyuningsih, 27 -06 1998, 656142, dx Dispepsia + low intake + melena. Coba obat dulu.\r\n2. Rusdi, 12 -08 -1958, 288850, dx hypertensi + DM type2, coba obat dulu.\r\n3. Rina, 11 -06- 1974, 702388, dx hiperglikemi, ht std2, sinusitis, GD 458, coba obat dulu.', 0, 'Tidak ada', 'Sisrute ditolak : \r\n1. RSUD sijunjung, dx penurunan kesadaran, gcs 9 + suspect metastase ca mamae std 4.\r\n2. RSIA Mutiara bunda, dx ARDS + butuh cpap , nicu penuh.\r\n3. RSUD Pariaman, Retensio urine + edema anasarca + suspect sindroma nephrotic.', 1, '2021-11-04 08:17:44', '2021-11-04 08:31:16'),
