(1177, 7, '75', 1179, 14, 2, 12, 7, 7, 0, 2, 0, 2, 'Pasien DOA 1 orang: Nedi Jamil/ 49 tahun, tiba di IGD jam 12.30.\r\nTolak Sisrute\r\n1. RSUD M.Thalib D/ Pneumonia + susp PDA dd/ USD butuh PICU\r\n2. RSUD M. Thalib D/ TC gcs 13 susp fraktur occipital dd/ EDH --> butuh Bedah Syaraf ( tgl 26/11 dr Alex Cahyadi cuti)', 1, NULL, NULL, 1, '2022-11-24 13:56:14', '2022-11-25 07:24:06'),
