(1277, 7, '73,77', 1280, 20, 1, 19, 15, 5, 2, 3, 0, 3, 'Tolak Rawat : \r\n1. an yuriko tiffany/ 01-07-2017/71-33-77 d/ asma tolak rawat coba obat\r\n2. tn Muhammad Amin/ 19-12-2004/ 73-22-07/ dyspepsia + hiperglikemia gdr 409  mau ke poli\r\n\r\nTolak sisrute : \r\n1. RS Mutiara Bunda / by feni 0 hr d/ RDS+  TTN TOLAK SISRUT  NICU PENUH \r\n2. RS Adnan WD/ JUMIARTI 50 TH / D/ TOTAL AV BLOK + DM +CKD TOLAK SISRUT\r\n3. RSUD PARIAMANNY. YULIARNI /60 TH D/ ENCEPALOPATI UREMIKA + CKD  TOLAK SISRUT.', 0, NULL, NULL, 1, '2022-12-28 06:16:25', '2022-12-28 07:34:11'),
