(1279, 30, '75,82', 1282, 19, 3, 16, 19, 0, 1, 4, 1, 3, 'Tolak rwt : - d/ Stemi + AF / laki2 / 65 thn / mau ke RS.M.Djamil.\r\nSisrut yg di tolak : - RS.M.Thalib / 71 thn / laki2 / Ileus susp Ca.Colon / anjuran RS UP M.djamil\r\n                                - RS.Ibnu Sina Bukit Tinggi / GGL Nafas + BBLR / Butuh Venti.\r\n                                - RS.M.Zein Painan / perempuan / 12 thn / tetraplegia ec susp GBS / Butuh Venti.\r\nSisrut yg di terima:\r\n                                - RS.BKM.Painan/perempuan / 69 thn / Stroke.H.+ Grandmal Seizure + Post HT', 0, NULL, NULL, 1, '2022-12-28 21:15:08', '2022-12-28 21:33:49'),
(1280, 76, '63,73', 1283, 26, 7, 19, 18, 8, 3, 2, 1, 1, 'Tolak sisrute \r\n1. Rscicik by, 0 hari dx rds  gagal C-Pap  butuh venti \r\ntolak rawat \r\n1. yohana / 34 thn / chf / cob obat \r\n2. budi yasma / 60 thn / asma / coba obat \r\n3. nurdin / 73thn/ n stemi/ keluarga mintak k rs mdjmil .', 0, NULL, NULL, 1, '2022-12-29 06:33:20', '2022-12-29 07:30:19'),
