(1283, 48, '63,75', 1286, 18, 7, 11, 11, 7, 0, 5, 0, 5, 'Tolak Sisrute\r\n1. RSUD Mayjen Thalib, d/ peritonitis difusa ec App perforasi, anjuran ke M Djamil\r\n2. RSUD Muko-muko, d/ Pneumonia Aspirasi + Susp Atresia esofagus, butuh bedah anak\r\n3. RS Aisyiyah Pariaman d/ CAP + Gagal nafas, HT , DM tipe II, butuh ventilator.\r\n4. RSUD Padang Pariaman, d/ peritonitis sudah konsul ke bedah digestif anjuran M Djamil\r\n5. RSUD Sungai Dareh d/ penurunan kesadaran ec CKD stage V, anjuran M Djamil.', 0, NULL, NULL, 1, '2022-12-30 05:49:15', '2022-12-30 07:06:29');
