(1309, 41, '80,83', 1312, 29, 3, 26, 15, 14, 1, 3, 2, 1, 'Rujuk:\r\n1.Tn.Yusrizal/55thn/d/stemi antero septall rujuk Mdjamil rencana PCI\r\ntolak sisrute:\r\n1.RSUD padang Panjang /GCS 8 Hcu penuh', 0, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-01-07 21:08:15', '2023-01-07 21:09:45'),
(1310, 78, '63,81', 1313, 22, 7, 15, 16, 6, 4, 4, 1, 3, 'tolak sisrute \r\n1. rsud sijunjung bayi 2 bln d/ perdarahan intrakranial butuh picu\r\n2. rsud ibnu sina payakumbuh laki laki 67 thn d/ tumor paru +metastase ku berat anj ke rsup djamil\r\n3. rsud sijunjung bayi 3 hari d/ hisprung butuh bedah anak\r\ntolak rawat\r\n1. Aa kenzie 4 thn d/ low intake coba obat\r\n2. Aa hamidah  / 5 thn d/ hiperpireksia coba obat\r\n3. Ny anzar/ 49 thn d/ PPOK coba obat\r\nrujuk ke rsuyp m. djamil\r\n1, m. athar/ 8 thn/ d/ app acut butuh bedah anak dan laparascopy', 0, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-01-08 07:02:17', '2023-01-08 07:24:00'),
(1311, 27, '75,82', 1314, 13, 1, 12, 9, 4, 0, 6, 2, 4, NULL, 0, NULL, 'Sisrute yg masuk\r\n1. RSUD Lubuk Basung/ Hepatoma + cirosis + cholelithiasis + post hematemesis ec  susp pecah varises + hep B / Febri Ardianto/ 40 thn/ ditolak\r\n2. RSUD Mayjen Thalib / CKD stage v + sepsis + trombositopeni + melena / Tn. Edi / 65 thn/ ditolak\r\n3. RSUD Mayjen Thalib / chest pain dd uap / Tn Johanes / 40 thn/ sdh konsul dr Ivan anjuran rujuk m jamil\r\n4. RS Yarsi / Penurunan kesadaran ec uremic enchelopaty + ckd stage v + anemia + melena / ny.Mardiati / 43 th/ ditolak\r\n5. RS Sijunjung / Ck GCS 14 + EDH / nn.Sintia / 13 thn/ diterima\r\n6. RSU BKM Painan / # linea temporal + vomitus / ny. Liza / 37 thn/ diterima', 1, '2023-01-08 14:03:02', '2023-01-08 14:23:05'),
(1312, 49, '78,83', 1315, 26, 5, 21, 15, 11, 0, 2, 0, 2, 'Tolak Sistrute :\r\n1. RSUD Bangko Tn hendra Tarmidi dengan Sepsis GCS 10 + DM tipe 2 + anemia berat + AKI alasan tolak\r\n2. RSUD Adnan WD Azizah dengan G5 P3 A1 usia kehamilan 34-35 minggu + PEB + DM tipe 2 + Edema Nasarka konsul dr Engga SpOG anjuran M. Djamil', 0, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-01-08 20:56:00', '2023-01-08 21:16:41'),
(1313, 56, '63,80', 1316, 25, 9, 16, 15, 10, 2, 3, 1, 2, 'tolak rawat\r\n1. Tn. Tundra Laksamana / 62 thn / PPOK / coba obat, BPJS ada.\r\n2. An. Harsya Fathian / 1 thn / Hiperpireksia / coba obat, Bpjs tidak ada.\r\n\r\ntolak Sisrute \r\n1. RSUD Aro Suka/  Ny. Fitri Kurnia / 16 thn / Dyspnoe ec BP saturasi 91% sudah pakai NRM 15 l/i, karena KU berat dan butuh HCU.\r\n2. RSUD muko muko / Tn. Surandi / 56 thn / Metastase Pulmonal Susp ILD, saturasi 93% sudah pakai NRM 15 l/i karena Ku berat dan HCU penuh.', 0, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-01-08 21:50:53', '2023-01-09 07:38:08'),
(1314, 42, '78', 1317, 15, 2, 13, 11, 4, 1, 4, 1, 3, 'tolak rawat :\r\n1. Trisma love yanti /37 thn / 73.28.20 / HT emergency ( TD : 210/130 mmHg ) coba obat\r\ntolak sisrute :\r\n1. Rumkit kerinci / sirosis hepatis + vasises bleeding ( butuh spesialis KGEH )\r\n2. RSUD Pariaman / hidropneumothorax ( kondisi berat dan pasien biasanya berobat ke mdjamil)\r\n3. RS Mayjen thalib / penurunan kesadaran + CHF ec CAD ( anjuran RSUP Mdjamil ) HCU juga penuh', 0, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-01-09 13:57:15', '2023-01-09 14:52:17'),
