(2909, 28, '77,92,93', 2936, 40, 6, 34, 24, 16, 0, 3, 0, 3, '1. RS Umum Daerah Kabupaten Sijunjung/ edi warman /PEREMPUAN /PERITONITIS (K65.0) + susp Perforasi Gaster dd peritonitis + Syok kardiogenik + anemia ec PSCBA----> Tolak, KU berat\r\n2. rsi Ibnu Sina simpang empat/Dahlan Rajo Gumanti/laki laki/96 th/Diagnosis : obs. Kejang ec suspek stroke haemoragik-----> Tolak , Ku berat\r\n3. RSUD MAYJEN H.A THALIB KOTA SUNGAI PENUH/by. by Ny. Popi/6 jam/Diagnosa : respiratory distress sindrom ec susp. HMD grade 2-3+ Aspirasi mekonium+susp early onset sepsis+NBBLR 1800gr-----> Tolak, KU berat (19.31-19.47 WIB)', 0, NULL, 'Poli dr Rendra\r\nLama : 39\r\nBaru : -', 1, '2024-06-23 20:25:58', '2024-06-23 21:12:50'),
