(2913, 7, '90,91', 2940, 35, 10, 25, 30, 5, 1, 5, 2, 3, 'TOLAK RAWA A/N BINTANG DWI ANANDA/10 THN/ DX APP ACUT : OS TDK MAU OPERASI, COBA OBAT SAJA, edukasi ada, tetap tolak rawat.\r\nTOLAK SISRUTE : ( 1. )RSUD SUNGAI DAREH DARMASRAYA/ TN TUGIMIN/77 THN/PERITONITIS DIFUSA EC SUSP APPENDICITIS PERFORASI+ TROMBOSITOPENIA: KU BERAT (2. )  RSUD PASAMAN  BARAT/ NANI ASMA/ 62 THN/ PENURUNAN KESADARAN EC SUSP STROKE HEMORAGIK ( ACC dr NOVI). (3) RSI IBNU SINA PAYAKUMBUH /TN IRAWAN/44 THN / HEMATEMESIS MELENA MASIF+ANEMIA BERAT+SIROSIS HEPATIS+ELEKTROLIT IMBALANCE+BP : BUTUH KGEH', 0, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-06-25 06:07:22', '2024-06-26 09:05:59'),
