(3191, 84, '75,85,90', 3219, 37, 3, 34, 30, 7, 0, 3, 1, 2, 'Tolak Sisrute :\r\n1. RSUD Bukittinggi / Ny. Fitriwati / 65th / dx : CKD Stage V + BP + Anemia -> Tolak Butuh HD\r\n2. RSUD Padang Pariaman / By.Minah Saputri / 4hari / dx : Gagal Nafas + Apneu Berulang + Sepsis Neonatorum -> Tolak KU Berat', 0, 'Tidak ada Masalah', '-', 1, '2024-09-25 20:39:33', '2024-09-25 20:57:26'),
