(4009, 95, '40,94', 4052, 22, 6, 16, 18, 4, 0, 6, 2, 4, 'Tolak rawat : 0\r\nRujukan via wa :\r\nDiterima : 2\r\nDitolak : 4\r\n1. Rsud padang panjang/anwar 64 th / tetraplegia ec spinal cord injury at the level of unspecified + tb paru dalam oat / butuh MRI / tolak ku berat\r\n2. RSUD RASIDIN/ Darman/Umur : 75 th / colic abd susp koledokolithiasis dengan kolestitis akut, disfungsi hati/ tolak butuh BD\r\n3. RS Paru Sumbar/ Indra syam/Gagal Nafas tipe II  dg penurunan kesadaran + SOPT + CAP NSTACS + Atrial Flutter+ AKI stage II + Hiperkalemia/ Tolak Ku berat\r\n4. RS naili Padang/  Tn. Jhon Hendra/59 th/* penurunan kesadaran ec Susp. enselopati/CKD stg 5/ tolak ku berat\r\n\r\nRujukan via sisrute \r\nDiterima : 0\r\nDitolak : 0', 0, 'Tidak ada', 'Tenaga IBS ns. tiara, ns. dina, ns. aloy dan ns. lisa bantu morning care di HR dan TH', 1, '2025-06-25 05:24:24', '2025-06-25 07:35:14'),
(4010, 7, '91,100', 4053, 19, 3, 16, 15, 4, 1, 4, 1, 3, 'tolak rawat :\r\n1. HUSIN / 71 thn / 00-30-67-44 / susp ileus obstruksi ec susp tumor intra abdomen / tolak rawat dan tolak rujuk / yakes telkom / mau langsung ke rsup mdjamil  / edukasi ada / tetap tolak rawat  dan tolak rujuk\r\n\r\nrujukan via wa\r\nterima: 1\r\ntolak : 3\r\n1. RSUD.Abundjani Bangko / Tn. Casyono / 73th / CKD stage 5 + oedema paru + PPOK + HIL (S) / tolak butuh HD 08.41-08.42\r\n2. RS LANGIT GOLDEN MEDIKA / RS LANGIT GOLDEN MEDIKA / Tn. Suhaimi / 56th / Ganggren diabetikum pedis (D) + DM tipe II insulin dependent + Dislipidemia / tolak butuh bedah vaskuler 10.17-10.19\r\n3.RSIA Sayang Ibu Batusangkar / BY MUHAMMAD AHSAN ARRAYAN / 1 hr / NBBLR 2200 GRAM LAHIR SC A/I  G5P3A1H3 GR 37-38 MINGGU + LETLI + BEKAS SC + KONTRAKSI + SKELETAL DISPLASIA + MULTIPLE CARDIAC ANOMALI / tolak KU berat 11.05-11.52\r\n\r\nrujukan via sisrute:\r\nterima:0\r\ntolak: 0', 0, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-06-25 13:59:02', '2025-06-26 10:20:15'),
